{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45136","headline":"奉陪颜使君真卿登岘山送张侍御严归台 · 皎然","name":"奉陪颜使君真卿登岘山送张侍御严归台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岘首千里情，北辕自兹发。\n烟霞正登览，簪笔限趋谒。\n黄鹤望天衢，白云归帝阙。\n客心南浦柳，离思西楼月。\n留赏景不延，感时芳易歇。\n他晨有山信，一爲访林樾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}